      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Flor Solitária. Floette usa comprimentos de onda vermelhos da luz para transferir sua energia às flores e despertar o potencial escondido nelas.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 8 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 5 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Fada &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 0% M / 100% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 2/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Floette pode evoluir para Florges no nível 14 ou superior, com a ajuda de uma Shiny Stone. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Fairy Wind, Tackle, Vine Whip</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Lucky Chant, Safeguard</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Razor Leaf</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Wish</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Grassy Terrain, Magical Leaf</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Petal Blizzard</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Aromatherapy, Synthesis</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Misty Terrain, Moonblast</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Petal Dance, Solar Beam</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>After You, Alluring Voice, Ally Switch, Attract, Baton Pass, Calm Mind, Charm, Chilling Water, Confide, Covet, Dazzling Gleam, Disarming Voice, Double Team, Draining Kiss, Echoed Voice, Endeavor, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, Frustration, Giga Drain, Grass Knot, Grassy Terrain, Heal Bell, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Light Screen, Magic Coat, Magical Leaf, Metronome, Misty Terrain, Nature Power, Petal Blizzard, Pollen Puff, Protect, Psychic, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Round, Safeguard, Seed Bomb, Skill Swap, Sleep Talk, Snore, Solar Beam, Stored Power, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger